WEBVTT

00:08:57.408 --> 00:09:00.035
When we see rapid
construction growth in our cities,

00:09:00.077 --> 00:09:02.538
we see signs of development
and of progress.

00:09:02.913 --> 00:09:04.832
But we should also ask

00:09:04.832 --> 00:09:07.293
for whom and at what cost.

00:09:08.002 --> 00:09:12.923
The insecurity and risks of day labor
should worry all of us,

00:09:12.923 --> 00:09:14.508
about the future of work.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.679
Unless we transform our approach

00:09:18.679 --> 00:09:22.391
to whose lives and labor matter.

00:09:23.267 --> 00:09:24.393
Thank you.